{"id":"97b4d5e7181b206d","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-quotient-ring.md","title":"Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives","display":"df-quotient-ring — Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-quotient-ring","aliases":["62-df-quotient-ring"],"display":"df-quotient-ring — Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives","depends_on":["[[62-df-ring-ideal]]","[[62-df-countable-ring]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-derivability]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition III.5.2","source_pages":[116],"source_pdf_pages":[134]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-quotient-ring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-quotient-ring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-ring — Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" href=\"?note=6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" title=\"62-df-ring-ideal\">62-df-ring-ideal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed16692e1133791f\" href=\"?note=ed16692e1133791f\" title=\"62-df-countable-ring\">62-df-countable-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition III.5.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>116</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R,I\">\\(\\mathcal R,I\\)</span> 的真理想条件见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" href=\"?note=6ff96e7e7c8bbf63\" title=\"62-df-ring-ideal\">62-df-ring-ideal</a>；环元组和运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ed16692e1133791f\" href=\"?note=ed16692e1133791f\" title=\"62-df-countable-ring\">62-df-countable-ring</a>；数值配对和函数图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。Rep、QuotMap、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_I\">\\(Q_I\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R/I\">\\(\\mathcal R/I\\)</span> 在下式引入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_I(r)\">\\(q_I(r)\\)</span> 只在 QuotMap 的唯一输出意义下使用。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rep}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rep}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QuotMap}\">\\(\\mathsf{QuotMap}\\)</span> 作为谓词对所有适型输入解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_I(r)\">\\(q_I(r)\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land r\\in R\">\\(\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land r\\in R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_I,M_I,J_I,\\mathcal R/I\">\\(A_I,M_I,J_I,\\mathcal R/I\\)</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\)</span> 假设下构造。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R=(R,A,M,J,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\mathcal R=(R,A,M,J,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> 是候选环元组，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为数集。最小代表和商运算图的存在唯一性在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a> 中使用；UC 和推导关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。没有这些算术假设时仍可展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rep},\\mathsf{QuotMap}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rep},\\mathsf{QuotMap}\\)</span> 的谓词，但不预设任意有元素的内部有界数类均有最小元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land t\\in R\\land\\forall s&lt;t\\;(s\\in R\\to t-_Rs\\notin I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow r\\in R\\land t\\le r\\land\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\land r-_Rt\\in I,\\\\\nQ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\},\\\\\nq_I(r)=t&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t),\\\\\nA_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a+_Rb)\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a\\cdot_Rb)\\},\\\\\nJ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle_N:a\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(-_Ra)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R/I&amp;\\coloneqq(Q_I,A_I,M_I,J_I,q_I(0_R),q_I(1_R)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land t\\in R\\land\\forall s&lt;t\\;(s\\in R\\to t-_Rs\\notin I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow r\\in R\\land t\\le r\\land\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\land r-_Rt\\in I,\\\\\nQ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\},\\\\\nq_I(r)=t&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t),\\\\\nA_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a+_Rb)\\},\\\\\nM_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a\\cdot_Rb)\\},\\\\\nJ_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle_N:a\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(-_Ra)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R/I&amp;\\coloneqq(Q_I,A_I,M_I,J_I,q_I(0_R),q_I(1_R)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[\n\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\\forall r\\in R\\ \\exists!t\\ \\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[\n\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\\forall r\\in R\\ \\exists!t\\ \\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\n\\exists Q\\exists G\\exists A&#39;\\exists M&#39;\\exists J&#39;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\forall t\\,[t\\in Q\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(G,R,Q)\\land\\forall r,t\\,[\\langle r,t\\rangle_N\\in G\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall z\\,[z\\in A&#39;\\leftrightarrow z\\in A_I]\\land\n\\forall z\\,[z\\in M&#39;\\leftrightarrow z\\in M_I]\\land\n\\forall z\\,[z\\in J&#39;\\leftrightarrow z\\in J_I]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\n\\exists Q\\exists G\\exists A&#39;\\exists M&#39;\\exists J&#39;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\forall t\\,[t\\in Q\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(G,R,Q)\\land\\forall r,t\\,[\\langle r,t\\rangle_N\\in G\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall z\\,[z\\in A&#39;\\leftrightarrow z\\in A_I]\\land\n\\forall z\\,[z\\in M&#39;\\leftrightarrow z\\in M_I]\\land\n\\forall z\\,[z\\in J&#39;\\leftrightarrow z\\in J_I]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同余类用数码最小代表，而不是以集合论的等价类作为 L₂ 对象。对 r，r 本身属于其同余类，所以在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\le r\">\\(t\\le r\\)</span> 中最小化有见证；真理想闭包给等价关系，保证代表唯一。环运算图是输入已给总图的复合，属 Δ⁰₁ 定义；RCA₀ 形成这些集合和总图，不使用普遍值域理解。两个常元是基环常元的代表，不预设等于自然数 0、1。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition III.5.2；纸面页 116；PDF 页 134。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ring-ideal","status":"resolved","id":"6ff96e7e7c8bbf63","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ring-ideal]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-countable-ring","status":"resolved","id":"ed16692e1133791f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-countable-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-4","