,"id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R=(R,A,M,J,0_R,1_R)$ 是候选环元组，$I$ 为数集。最小代表和商运算图的存在唯一性在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中使用；UC 和推导关系见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。没有这些算术假设时仍可展开 $\\mathsf{Rep},\\mathsf{QuotMap}$ 的谓词，但不预设任意有元素的内部有界数类均有最小元。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R=(R,A,M,J,0_R,1_R)$ 是候选环元组，$I$ 为数集。最小代表和商运算图的存在唯一性在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中使用；UC 和推导关系见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。没有这些算术假设时仍可展开 $\\mathsf{Rep},\\mathsf{QuotMap}$ 的谓词，但不预设任意有元素的内部有界数类均有最小元。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R,I","display":false},{"tex":"Q_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R/I","display":false},{"tex":"q_I(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rep}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{QuotMap}","display":false},{"tex":"q_I(r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"A_I,M_I,J_I,\\mathcal R/I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R=(R,A,M,J,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rep},\\mathsf{QuotMap}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\land t\\in R\\land\\forall s<t\\;(s\\in R\\to t-_Rs\\notin I),\\\\\n\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)&\\leftrightarrow r\\in R\\land t\\le r\\land\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\land r-_Rt\\in I,\\\\\nQ_I&\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)\\},\\\\\nq_I(r)=t&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t),\\\\\nA_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a+_Rb)\\},\\\\\nM_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N:a,b\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(a\\cdot_Rb)\\},\\\\\nJ_I&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle_N:a\\in Q_I\\land c=q_I(-_Ra)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R/I&\\coloneqq(Q_I,A_I,M_I,J_I,q_I(0_R),q_I(1_R)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[\n\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\\forall r\\in R\\ \\exists!t\\ \\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[\\mathsf{Ideal}(\\mathcal R,I)\\to\n\\exists Q\\exists G\\exists A'\\exists M'\\exists J'\\Bigl(&\n\\forall t\\,[t\\in Q\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Rep}(\\mathcal R,I,t)]\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf{Fun}(G,R,Q)\\land\\forall r,t\\,[\\langle r,t\\rangle_N\\in G\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{QuotMap}(\\mathcal R,I,r,t)]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall z\\,[z\\in A'\\leftrightarrow z\\in A_I]\\land\n\\forall z\\,[z\\in M'\\leftrightarrow z\\in M_I]\\land\n\\forall z\\,[z\\in J'\\leftrightarrow z\\in J_I]\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"t\\le r","display":false}],"bytes":3458,"backlinks":[{"id":"74ce06f3ea39afa2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]，$q_I,\\mathcal R/I$ 见 [[62-df-quotient-ring]]，Ring、IDom、Field 见 [[62-df-countable-ring]]、[[62-df-countable-field]]，Ideal、Prime、MaxIdeal、RadIdeal 见 [[62-df-ring-ideal]]、[[62-df-prime-maximal-radical-ideal]]。UC 和 $\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-163","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-quotient-ring|Quotient Ring Codes by Least Representatives]]"},{"id":"8977785096757e51","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-quotient-ring]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-275","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-quotient-ring]]"}],"outgoing":["6ff96e7e7c8bbf63","ed16692e1133791f","c156c03daff0aff0","dd5e8930337c8b20","4c6d2d9f1999915f","98c3cbeb95500b53"]}